      "description": "Uses inventory_has because the crafted wooden_axe ends up in the player's inventory. Player starts with exactly 3 oak_planks + 2 sticks (the exact recipe) and must use the crafting table at (~3,0,2). Not satisfiable at init since no wooden_axe exists in starting inventory.",
