        {
          "type": "inventory_has",
          "params": {
            "item": "wooden_axe",
            "min_count": 1
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "task": "mine light_blue_wool",
      "milestone_id": "mine_light_blue_wool",
      "description": "Uses inventory_has because mining a wool block drops the wool item into inventory. Player starts with no wool items. Light blue wool blocks are placed at (~-4,0,3), (~-4,1,3), and (~-3,0,3). Breaking any one of them adds light_blue_wool to inventory.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "type": "inventory_has",
          "params": {
            "item": "light_blue_wool",
            "min_count": 1
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "task": "find magenta_wool",
      "milestone_id": "find_magenta_wool",
      "description": "Uses position_near_with_facing because this is a find/locate task where the player must navigate to the magenta wool blocks and observe them. Target is the center of the magenta wool cluster at (~5,1,3). Player spawns at (0,0,0) which is ~5.9 blocks away (exceeds max_distance=5), so not satisfied at init. Facing tolerance of 60° ensures player is looking toward the blocks.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "type": "position_near_with_facing",
          "params": {
            "target": [5, 1, 3],
            "max_distance": 5,
            "facing_tolerance": 60,
            "coordinate_frame": "spawn_relative"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "task": "shear sheep",
      "milestone_id": "shear_sheep",
      "description": "Uses inventory_has because shearing a white sheep drops white_wool into inventory. This is unambiguous since no white wool blocks exist in the scene (only light_blue and magenta wool blocks are placed). The only source of white_wool is shearing one of the two white NoAI sheep at (~0,0,5) and (~1,0,6). Player has shears in starting inventory.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "type": "inventory_has",
          "params": {
            "item": "white_wool",
            "min_count": 1
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

### Design Rationale Summary:

| Task | Rule Type | Why This Rule | Init-Safe? |
|------|-----------|---------------|------------|
| craft to wooden_axe | inventory_has | Crafted item goes to inventory; no axe at start | ✅ Not satisfied at init |
| mine light_blue_wool | inventory_has | Mined wool drops as item; no wool in starting inventory | ✅ Not satisfied at init |
| find magenta_wool | position_near_with_facing | Find/locate task — player must navigate near target and face it; spawn distance ~5.9 > threshold 5 | ✅ Not satisfied at init |
| shear sheep | inventory_has | Shearing white sheep drops white_wool; no white wool blocks in scene makes this unambiguous | ✅ Not satisfied at init |

### Key Design Decisions:
1. **Preferred inventory_has for 3/4 tasks** — directly reflects what the player accomplished (crafted, mined, sheared) via items appearing in inventory.
2. **position_near_with_facing for find task** — correctly models "player can see the magenta wool" without requiring them to mine or interact with it.
3. **No position_inside_box used** — none of these tasks are pure navigation/movement tasks.
4. **White wool disambiguation** — CommonSenseAgent confirmed that white_wool can only come from shearing the white sheep since no white wool blocks exist in the scene.
